### 署名、贡献与科研验证 / Attribution, contribution and scientific validation

**中文**：作者身份、外部开源参与、图形可视化审阅和机构／出版商认证不可相互推断；使用者须按本仓许可及第三方数据来源分别致谢，DOI 仅标识相应软件出版物

**English**: Authorship, external open-source participation, scientific figure review and publisher or institutional certification are not interchangeable. Attribute repository-owned work and third-party sources separately; a DOI identifies its software publication object

